#. Description of the plugin
#: easy-replace-image.php
#: parts/settings.php:20
msgid "This plugin allows you to replace an attachment file by uploading another image or by downloading one from a specified URL, without deleting the attachment. The plugin handles the sub-sizes generation and the attachment metadata update, and you will see the result right away."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: easy-replace-image.php
msgid "Iulia Cazan"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
